This directory contains a compiled build of lkqmoe (liblkqmoe.so, liblkqmoe_cuda.so and the
compiled Python adapter lkqmoe/*.pyc). The lkqmoe source code is not published.

Permission is granted, free of charge, to use and to redistribute these files unmodified,
together with or separately from this repository, for any purpose. Reverse engineering,
decompilation and redistribution of modified copies are not permitted.

The open files in this directory (python/sitecustomize.py, python/lkqmoe/gpu/*.py,
python/lkqmoe/gpu/fp8_configs/*.json, tools/*.py) are licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
like the rest of this repository.

Idea and upstream reference: lk_moe (guqiong96/Lsglang), the CPU-offloaded MoE backend of
lsglang. lkqmoe is an independent implementation of its MOE_NVFP4 interface and contains no
lk_moe code.

